# Noon cron schedule (UTC+4 Asia/Muscat).
#
# Every minute: drain outbox + run calendar reminders + class WhatsApp.
# Every day at 08:00: birthday greetings (idempotent via outbox dedupe_key).
#
# All jobs run against the same unified endpoint; the tick runner decides
# which internal jobs to execute.

* * * * * /usr/local/bin/tick.sh tick 2>&1
0 8 * * * /usr/local/bin/tick.sh birthday 2>&1
